   Israel Nature and Parks Authority;  {[}I-2504-413.13/2018]},
Funding-Text = {We owe a huge thank you to Zehava Sigal and the Zin Valley Nature
   Reserve staff for their amazing cooperation. We thank David Saltz, Ariel
   Novoplansky, Shirli Bar-David, Uri Roll and Daniel Blumstein for
   insightful discussions and ideas. We are grateful to Jonathan Tichon for
